Changes in v2.9 2026-11-24:
– Support for ConTeXt LMTX (LuaMetaTeX).
– Spaces between \begin{scontents} and its optional argument are ignored.
– Document output files in subdirectories and \Scontents in arguments.
– Tagged PDF documentation and more syntax colouring in the examples.
– Add regression tests for ConTeXt LMTX.
